.Dd March 12, 2026
.Dt RELEASE_REGION 9
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm release_region
.Nd release a previously reserved I/O port range
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In kern/resource.h
.Ft void
.Fn release_region "resource_size_t start" "resource_size_t n"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Fn release_region
function removes the exact matching I/O port reservation from the global
resource tree.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr request_region 9 ,
.Xr resource 9
